  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies how a color sequence changes between control point colors.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>This .NET enumeration represents the interpolation constants declared by <see cref="T:Android.Hardware.Lights.ColorSequence" />. <see cref="F:Android.Hardware.Lights.InterpolationMode.None" /> holds the previous color until the delay ends. <see cref="F:Android.Hardware.Lights.InterpolationMode.Linear" /> changes each color channel linearly during the delay.</para>
      <para>See the <see href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/94b4c163b7dfe5ce3607f7bb8456f9573f7de57d/core/java/android/hardware/lights/ColorSequence.java">Android 17 interpolation definitions</see>.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
