      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>No interpolation between control points.</para>
          <para>With this interpolation mode, color[n-1] will be held for the corresponding duration specified in delayMillis. After that, color[n] will be applied without any intermediate steps.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/lights/ColorSequence#INTERPOLATION_MODE_NONE" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.lights.ColorSequence.INTERPOLATION_MODE_NONE</code>.</a></format></para>
